# Dhan binary frame: one quote packet (code 4) followed by eight zero bytes
# of padding, as issue #2502 saw it (web test/test_dhan_quote_feed.py::
# test_trailing_zero_length_header_stops_parse: quote_frame() + b"\x00" * 8).
04                      # response code 4 (quote)
3200                    # message length 50, header included
01                      # exchange segment 1 (NSE_EQ)
450b0000                # security id 2885
0090a244                # ltp
1900                    # last traded quantity
a0680169                # last trade time, epoch s
0048a244                # average traded price
409c0000                # volume
581b0000                # total sell quantity
28230000                # total buy quantity
0040a144                # open
00000000                # day close (0 until the market closes)
00c0a344                # high
00a0a044                # low
# Padding: read as a header, its length 0 is shorter than the 8-byte header,
# so the parser stops here (web f83592a0b; desktop DhanFeed::parse_binary).
0000000000000000
